{
  "contract": "C7",
  "title": "GET /api/sessions and GET /api/sessions/{session_id}: browsing sessions with attention summaries",
  "drafted_by": "P",
  "sources": [
    "SPEC.md §8.1 (browser_sessions), §8.5, §10",
    "BUILD_TASKS.md §4.6, §4.11, P-7"
  ],
  "notes": [
    "Scenario: R's shared demo set. Tab IDs come from apps/api/app/engine/fixtures/demo_tabs.json (the 28 tabs in snapshot.example.json); project, claim, note and saved-context IDs come from grove.example.json and memory-search.example.json. IDs these examples create are listed in `introduces`; IDs that belong to another user are listed in `unknown_ids`.",
    "Every request carries Authorization: Bearer <token> unless the example lists request.headers explicitly. user_id never appears in a request body; the server takes it from the token.",
    "Durations are integer milliseconds (active_ms) so every sum is exact; the UI converts to minutes. Times are UTC and follow R's story clock (snapshot at 2026-10-04T11:40:00Z).",
    "Errors are RFC 7807 problem JSON with `instance` = the request path, as in R's files.",
    "GET /api/sessions?range=24h lists sessions that started in the range, newest first; range is 24h or 7d (default 24h).",
    "The server is the only owner of sessions: a session closes after a 30-minute gap between events (by event ts); ended_at is null while it is open.",
    "active_ms is the sum of active_ms on the session's BLUR events. projects[] splits it by project and unassigned_ms is time on tabs with no project yet. A tab in two projects counts for both (tab 05 here is shared by Backend Authentication and GirlHacks Prep), so projects can add up to more than active_ms.",
    "Switch counts: tab_switches counts FOCUS events that moved to a different tab; intent_switches those whose two tabs share no cluster; unassigned_switches those where either tab has no cluster yet. Two tabs of the same project are a tab switch only.",
    "GET /api/sessions/{session_id} adds tabs[]: every tab focused in the session with its active_ms and project_ids; tabs[].active_ms adds up to active_ms. Tab 30 is a GirlHacks page that was closed later.",
    "Totals agree with R's grove: Backend Authentication today = morning + late session = the timeline total; GirlHacks Prep (41 min) and Weeknight Dinner (9 min) happen entirely in these sessions. A third Backend Authentication session on Oct 2 is outside this 24h range; with it the project reaches 134 min (saved-context resume).",
    "A session the caller does not own returns 404."
  ],
